WEBVTT

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:30.250
the better their counterparts did.

00:14:31.083 --> 00:14:34.101
Smart negotiators found creative ways
of helping the other side

00:14:34.125 --> 00:14:35.684
that cost them nothing.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:39.351
(Upbeat music)

00:14:39.375 --> 00:14:41.809
This busts a fourth myth of negotiating.

00:14:41.833 --> 00:14:45.643
You don't have to lose
to help the other person win.

00:14:45.667 --> 00:14:47.934
Decades of evidence show
that great negotiators

00:14:47.958 --> 00:14:50.976
don't just care about
maximizing their own success,

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.684
they're also motivated
to help the other person succeed.

00:14:54.708 --> 00:14:57.018
Jason realized that if he wanted results,

00:14:57.042 --> 00:15:00.559
he had to help players
and agents get results too,